cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and acknowledge SDSS as described in DATA.md."
title: "galaxy-spectroscopy: redshift estimation and emission-line analysis of optical galaxy spectra"
abstract: >-
  A Python package that measures galaxy redshifts, continuum-subtracted
  integrated H-alpha, H-beta, [O III] 5008 and [N II] 6585 emission-line fluxes,
  and 1-sigma uncertainties from flux-calibrated optical spectra, by a joint fit
  of the H-alpha and H-beta complexes at a common redshift.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-13
license: MIT
authors:
